 "notes": [
  "The unit list is a subset of UNECE Rec 20/21; a valid code outside it fails and needs a new pack version (safe direction).",
  "The margin-scheme tax category is not confirmed at source and is not in this pack.",
  "RP-1 covers mandatory fields at source-data level, not all 132 PINT AE jurisdiction rules (SRC-12). A pass is not a pass at an ASP.",
  "B1 fix round 1 (2026-11-11, before any production publication): RC-19 made blocking, RC-08 extended to commercial invoices without a customer link, country validation added to RC-04/RC-06, RC-21 and RC-22 added. RP-1 had not been published outside local and test databases, so the correction is made under the same code; any later change is a new pack version (AD-07)."
 ],
